    {
      "text": "I will give thanks unto thee, O Lord, 2 Sam. 22:50 (Ps. 18:49). Give thanks unto the Lord, 1 Chr. 16:8 (16:34; Ps. 105:1; 106:1; 136:1; 1 Ne. 2:7; 5:9). sang together … in praising and giving thanks unto the Lord, Ezra 3:11. It is a good thing to give thanks unto the Lord, Ps. 92:1. give thanks unto the God of gods, Ps. 136:2. kneeled … and gave thanks before his God, Dan. 6:10.",
